IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `da-distress`

-- Distress Act 1934, ss 3-5, 8-10, 12, 13, 15, 19-24 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_distress-act-1934.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

